      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Welcome, welcome! Please, feel free to take a moments rest, and allow
          me, The High Priest Ishmael, to congratulate you on nearly completing your
          journey! Let me regale to you the tale of the first Whale as you prepare
          yourself to receive their good graces above-
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
