        value: 8
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Conversant
        value: 8
        type: 5
        typeString: CustomFieldType_Actor
      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: But it is a shame to see so many people arrive in such a sorry state.
          It seems the world is becoming crueler to those still left behind. If only
          they could make up their minds and seek salvation, as you have.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      conversationID: 5
      isRoot: 0
      isGroup: 0
      nodeColor: 
      delaySimStatus: 0
      falseConditionAction: Block
