      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: -Yes, I believe they have even granted me the highest honor- to be
          immortal until I am the last remnant of humanity. And when I gaze over
          the then fully cleansed earth from high atop this tower, and see that all
          is right, I may ascend to their sacred realm as well.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
