      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: It is a futile resistance. Those people are confused, or frightened
          of what they do not understand. Perhaps you have met one of those radical
          protestors?
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
        value: 
        type: 0
