      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: Resistance has been around since the beginning of the tower's construction.
          First they were many, but over the years I have seen more and more of them
          climb up the last steps and never return.
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Sequence
