      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "I think this says enough. This is our true purpose, something I\u2019ve
          worked tirelessly to achieve for decades! Even now, people still hold on
          to this old, decaying world.. I pity them, and hope they make up their
          minds soon."
        type: 0
